    "To connect, [get your free API key](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) and paste it above.": {
      "comment": "Discogs settings: how to connect (markdown link)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To connect, [get your free API key](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) and paste it above."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para conectar, [consigue tu clave de API gratuita](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) y pégala arriba."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour vous connecter, [obtenez votre clé d'API gratuite](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) et collez-la ci-dessus."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Verbinden [hol dir deinen kostenlosen API-Schlüssel](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) und füge ihn oben ein."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para conectar, [obtenha sua chave de API gratuita](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) e cole-a acima."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続するには、[無料のAPIキーを取得](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers)して上に貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需连接，请[获取你的免费 API 密钥](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers)并粘贴到上方。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "للاتصال، [احصل على مفتاح API المجاني](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) والصقه أعلاه."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "כדי להתחבר, [השיגו מפתח API חינמי](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) והדביקו אותו למעלה."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Щоб підключитися, [отримайте безкоштовний ключ API](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) і вставте його вище."
          }
        },
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "За да се свържете, [вземете безплатния си API ключ](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) и го поставете по-горе."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aby połączyć, [uzyskaj darmowy klucz API](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) i wklej go powyżej."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro připojení [získejte svůj bezplatný API klíč](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) a vložte jej výše."
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za povezivanje [nabavite svoj besplatni API ključ](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) i zalijepite ga iznad."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "연결하려면 [무료 API 키를 받기](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) 후 위에 붙여 넣으세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To search Discogs, [get your free API key](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) and add it in settings.": {
      "comment": "Import search: popover instructing the user to add a Discogs API key (markdown link)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To search Discogs, [get your free API key](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) and add it in settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para buscar en Discogs, [consigue tu clave de API gratuita](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) y añádela en los ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour rechercher sur Discogs, [obtenez votre clé d'API gratuite](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) et ajoutez-la dans les réglages."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um Discogs zu durchsuchen, [hol dir deinen kostenlosen API-Schlüssel](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) und füge ihn in den Einstellungen hinzu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para buscar no Discogs, [obtenha sua chave de API gratuita](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) e adicione-a nas configurações."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discogs を検索するには、[無料のAPIキーを取得](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers)して設定で追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需搜索 Discogs，请[获取你的免费 API 密钥](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers)并在设置中添加。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "للبحث في Discogs، [احصل على مفتاح API المجاني](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) وأضفه في الإعدادات."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "כדי לחפש ב-Discogs, [השיגו מפתח API חינמי](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) והוסיפו אותו בהגדרות."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Щоб шукати в Discogs, [отримайте безкоштовний ключ API](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) і додайте його в налаштуваннях."
          }
        },
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "За да търсите в Discogs, [вземете безплатния си API ключ](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) и го добавете в настройките."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aby przeszukiwać Discogs, [uzyskaj darmowy klucz API](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) i dodaj go w ustawieniach."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro vyhledávání na Discogs [získejte svůj bezplatný API klíč](https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers) a přidejte jej v nastavení."
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
